<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Checklist — TaxiBoek</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root { --dark: #0f0f1a; --accent: #f5c842; --white: #fdf8f0; --gray: #f0e8d8; --text: #1a1a2e; --muted: #6b6b80; --border: #e8dfc8; --green: #16a34a; }
  body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: var(--text); background: var(--white); min-height: 100vh; }

  nav { background: var(--dark); padding: 0 24px; height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .nav-logo { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 22px; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
  .nav-back { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-back:hover { color: #fff; }

  .hero { background: var(--dark); padding: 48px 24px 40px; text-align: center; }
  .hero-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: rgba(245,200,66,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(245,200,66,0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .hero h1 { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 32px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .hero p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); max-width: 440px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6; }

  .progress-bar { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); height: 6px; }
  .progress-fill { background: var(--accent); height: 100%; transition: width 0.4s ease; width: 0%; }

  .main { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 60px; }

  .progress-label { text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .progress-label strong { color: var(--text); }

  .category { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .cat-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .cat-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .cat-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }
  .cat-count { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-left: auto; }

  .check-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .check-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .check-item:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .check-item.done { background: #f0fdf4; border-color: #bbf7d0; }
  .check-box { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.2s; background: var(--white); }
  .check-item.done .check-box { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); }
  .check-box-tick { display: none; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .check-item.done .check-box-tick { display: block; }
  .check-content { flex: 1; }
  .check-label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 500; }
  .check-item.done .check-label { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: line-through; }
  .check-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .check-item.done .check-sub { color: #86efac; }

  .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 28px 0; }

  .done-banner { display: none; background: var(--green); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .done-banner.show { display: block; }
  .done-banner h2 { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 22px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .done-banner p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .whatsapp-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #fff; color: var(--green); border: none; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; }

  .whatsapp-float { position: fixed; bottom: 24px; right: 24px; background: #25d366; color: #fff; border-radius: 50px; padding: 12px 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(37,211,102,0.4); transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .whatsapp-float:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

  .tip-box { background: var(--gray); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .tip-box h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .tip-box p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  .reset-btn { display: block; margin: 24px auto 0; background: none; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 18px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
  .reset-btn:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--text); }

  footer { text-align: center; padding: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">🚕 Taxi<span>Boek</span></a>
  <a href="index.html" class="nav-back">← Terug naar home</a>
</nav>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-tag">✓ Jouw persoonlijke checklist</div>
  <h1>Heb je alles bij de hand?</h1>
